{"schema_version":"hadith-bank-search-record-v1","id":"deenhindi-muslim:3","language":"hi","source_language_code":"hi","book_key":"muslim","edition":"deenhindi-web-20261112","source_id":"deenhindi-muslim","provider_entry_id":"3","title":"Chapter 0","text_arabic":"وَحَدَّثَنِي زُهَيْرُ بْنُ حَرْبٍ، حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ، - يَعْنِي ابْنَ عُلَيَّةَ - عَنْ عَبْدِ الْعَزِيزِ بْنِ صُهَيْبٍ، عَنْ أَنَسِ بْنِ مَالِكٍ، أَنَّهُ قَالَ إِنَّهُ لَيَمْنَعُنِي أَنْ أُحَدِّثَكُمْ حَدِيثًا كَثِيرًا أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏ \"‏ مَنْ تَعَمَّدَ عَلَىَّ كَذِبًا فَلْيَتَبَوَّأْ مَقْعَدَهُ مِنَ النَّارِ ‏\"‏ ‏.‏","text_translation":"हज़रत अनस बिन मालिक (रज़ियल्लाहु अन्हु) से रिवायत है, कहा: मुझे तुम्हारे सामने ज़्यादा अहादीस बयान करने से यह बात रोकती है की रसूल अल्लाह (सल्लल्लाहु अलैहि वसल्लम) ने फ़रमाया था: 'जिस ने अमदन मुझ पर झूठ बोला वह आग में अपना ठिकाना बना ले।'","number":{"source_entry_id":"3","in_book":null,"canonical":null,"scope":"source_site","as_printed":"[ Sahih Muslim   3 ]","numbering_system":"Deen Hindi source numbering; not assumed identical across editions"},"narrator":{"name":null,"as_supplied":{"narrator":null,"narratorHindi":null,"narratorUrdu":null,"narratorEnglish":null}},"source":{"name":"Deen Hindi — Sahih Muslim","work_title":"Deen Hindi — Sahih Muslim","url":"https://deenhindi.com/hadith/muslim","record_url":"https://deenhindi.com/hadith/muslim/3","original_file":"materials/deenhindi-muslim/source-index.json","sha256":"ef370e330bd62e63a9e1feb68d075e2edb648ad63f4ba6c2c1c170e45d0bec78","record_locator":{"path":"materials/deenhindi-muslim/records.jsonl","line":1},"format":"html_snapshot_index","original_metadata":{"title":"Deen Hindi — Sahih Muslim","url":"https://deenhindi.com/hadith/muslim","record_url":"https://deenhindi.com/hadith/muslim/3","source_internal_id":22770,"snapshot":{"bytes":86578,"compression":"gzip","content_type":"text/html; charset=utf-8","final_url":"https://deenhindi.com/hadith/muslim/3","path":"imports/web-deenhindi-2